# Data and artifacts
# data/processed/ # pushing processed data to github
# data/external/  # pushing synthetic data to github
# ml/artifacts/   # pushing the canonical, top-level model catalog to github
# ml/artifacts/runs/ holds ad-hoc local training runs (can be tens/hundreds of MB
# each); only the pinned catalog artifacts directly under ml/artifacts/ are the
# reproducible, documented production/candidate models, so runs/ is excluded.
ml/artifacts/runs/
docs/IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
backend/.venv/
frontend/node_modules/  
frontend/dist/

